## 1. 已验证的真实 Context 架构

`context.facade.build_context_prompt` 是全仓唯一提示词装配入口（tools.py / server.py / server_handlers_* 全部 `from context import build_context_prompt`，零绕过）。其五阶段管线：

```mermaid
flowchart TB
    subgraph PIPE[context.facade 五阶段]
      C1[1 Collect] --> C2[2 Rank]
      C2 --> C3[3 Budget]
      C3 --> C4[4 Bundle<br/>dedup_items_by_scope]
      C4 --> C5[5 Build]
    end
    C5 --> LLM[LLM]
```

数据模型已存在（`context/models.py`，真实）：
- `ContextItem`：`source / content / priority / recency / importance / user_relevance / token_est / metadata(含 DEDUP_SCOPE_KEY)`
- `ContextBundle`、`BuildContext`、`ContextSource` 枚举（IDENTITY/MEMORY/GOAL/WORLD/WEATHER/SYSTEM/USER/EPISODIC/PERSONALITY/WORKFLOW/KNOWLEDGE/TOOL/CONVERSATION/LEGACY_DELEGATE/CURRENT_TASK/MEMORY_V2）
- `dedup_items_by_scope`（COND-A3，已实现，按 dedup_scope 去重）

