| UserModelSource | FEATURE_USER_MODEL | **KEEP** | 返回 ContextItem，不拼提示词 |
| EpisodicSource | FEATURE_EPISODIC_MEMORY | **KEEP** | 情节记忆 |
| PersonalitySource | FEATURE_PERSONALITY | **KEEP** | 人格（纯 prompt 附加） |
| GoalSource | FEATURE_GOAL_SYSTEM | **KEEP** | 目标 |
| KnowledgeSource | FEATURE_KNOWLEDGE_PLATFORM | **KEEP** | 知识召回 |
| PersonalContextSource | FEATURE_PERSONAL_CONTEXT | **KEEP** | 当前状态 |
| PersonalAISource | FEATURE_PERSONAL_AI | **KEEP** | 统一画像 |
| IdentitySource | FEATURE_IDENTITY | **KEEP** | 身份 |
| MemoryRecallSource | FEATURE_MEMORY_INTELLIGENCE | **MERGE** | 并入 EvolvedMemorySource（同 scope=memory） |
