## 6. 重复读取问题解法

```mermaid
graph TB
    subgraph BEFORE[当前: 双读]
      MS[MemorySource monolith] -->|读 profile+summary+chat+learnings| DB1[(多表)]
      UMS[UserModelSource] -->|重读 profile/user_model| DB1
      ES[EpisodicSource] -->|重读 episodes| DB1
    end
    subgraph AFTER[P4.4: 单读]
      RMS[EvolvedMemorySource] -->|仅 memories| MEM[(memories)]
      RT[RuntimeStateSource] -->|仅运行时状态| RTB[(reminders/geo/...)]
      UMS2[UserModelSource] -->|仅 user_model| UM[(user_model)]
      ES2[EpisodicSource] -->|仅 episodes| EP[(episodes)]
    end
```

- monolith 退役 → 每类数据由唯一 Source 读取，消除重复。
- `DEDUP_SCOPE_KEY` 兜底：即便多源声明同 scope，重复事实逐字节去重（COND-A3）。

